<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's foreign debt at $12.49 bln in October.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's foreign debt at $12.49 bln in October.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's foreign debt rose to $12.49 billion in October, up from $12.33 billion in the same month a year earlier and $12.48 billion in September, the central bank said Tuesday.</p>
<p>As a percent of gross domestic product, however, Ecuador's foreign debt levels fell. They stood at 66.5 percent of GDP in October, down from from 68.5 percent in the same month a year earlier.</p>
<p>((--Franz Bastidas, Quito Newsroom, (5932) 258429))</p>
